# Dependencies
**/node_modules/
**/.pnpm-store/

# Local environment and credentials
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Logs and transient process files
**/*.log
**/*.pid
**/.tmp/
**/.tmp-*
**/.cache/
**/.boot-check/
